== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Luna|Luna]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Luna's effect only provided extra Secret and Super Secret rooms.
* "Luna" is the word for "[[Wikipedia:moon|moon]]" in Latin and some of its descendant languages, and is sometimes used to distinguish the Earth's Moon from other natural satellites.

